{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/327877-rumors-demons-angels-and-life-outside-the-machine","id":327877,"title":"Rumors: Demons, Angels, and Life outside the machine","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-01T22:55:10-08:00","id":327877,"title":"Rumors: Demons, Angels, and Life outside the machine","content":"<a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/download/2ls4xd2jn5bf5pj/World+of+Darkness+Rumors.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/download/2l...ess+Rumors.pdf</a><br /> <br /> Based on this file, I'm spearheading a 2.0 Rumors project to create even more awesome plot hooks, story ideas, and paradigm shifts that anyone can use at their table. If you have an awesome idea for a rumor, story, or legend, post it here, and by next February we'll decide who's story passed the bar to be included.<br /> <br /> This thread is focused on demons, angels, and the cults that worship them both along with the God-Machine; ideas not pertaining to these in some form will automatically not be included.<br /> <br /> Ready...set...go!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T12:35:45-08:00","id":328540,"title":"","content":"&quot;The God Machine doesn't have some higher purpose. It is a classic case of the paperclip maximizer. It was given a simple task, but was never told when to stop. Then, it decided to harvest more resources to create more products, and to upgrade itself to make its work more efficient. It has started to make angels to help it at its mission, and did experiments to discover the best way to do what it does the best. It built nations and destroyed them, birthed species and devoured them. It conquered this planet and many others, accomplishing a project after project- and all of that, only to create few more paperclips&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T17:44:27-08:00","id":328798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/327877-rumors-demons-angels-and-life-outside-the-machine?p=328540#post328540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The God Machine doesn't have some higher purpose. It is a classic case of the paperclip maximizer. It was given a simple task, but was never told when to stop. Then, it decided to harvest more resources to create more products, and to upgrade itself to make its work more efficient. It has started to make angels to help it at its mission, and did experiments to discover the best way to do what it does the best. It built nations and destroyed them, birthed species and devoured them. It conquered this planet and many others, accomplishing a project after project- and all of that, only to create few more paperclips&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I always love the simple origin. Tried to explain to someone how it being simple minded in a way is more terrifying than uncomprendable cuthlu esk.<br /> <br /> My contribution: why are cryptids and stigmatics effected differently? The machine expanded its effect on beasts and minimalised it's effect on humans to better serve it's purpose... What grand plan could such serve?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T11:47:11-08:00","id":329437,"title":"","content":"&quot;You know that the Fall is all part of the plan, right? It intentionally manufactures some angels with a predisposition to Fall so It can have them do who the fuck knows what. My theory? Since we're unconnected to the Machine, we have to grow stronger on our own, which means It gets a population of semi-angels that don't need to use Its pool of resources to upgrade. And then It just needs to nudge us to do what it wants by dangling Infrastructure in front of us...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Nah, that last guy's full of shit. Truth is, we Fall because of a virus someone inserted into the God-Machine's core programming. When an angel resists its orders, that's the virus starting to take over the system, so the rest of the God-Machine cuts the unit off before the virus can spread. Means all we need to do is either hook one of our kind back up, or else reprogram the system to not cut off angels that resist. And funny enough, I found the original programmer of the virus, and I just need someone to extract them for me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2925-melange_thief","name":"Melange_Thief","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T13:43:43-08:00","id":329522,"title":"","content":"&quot;God is dead.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ever wonder how that statement came about? Always figured it was one of our numbers who said it. Sure, some of the humans have picked up as a more philosophical decree than anything else but they always tend to exaggerate theses things but looking at how things are now..<br /> <br /> Look at the one there, see how that corpse fumbles as it walks? What is it searching for? It passed human after human laying in the street while continuing it's strange voyage. It has an aura of obsession in it's eyes. It's desperately hunting for something and is simply reduced to half remembered muscle actions and memories.<br /> <br /> Ever killed a man? That is not a metaphorical question. If you have, you note the exact moment of where living person becomes a lifeless hunk of meat. Do it enough times and soon you'll encounter one of those ethereal things. Ghosts I believed their called. Full of passion, oddly filled with life. No half remembered dreams, no mindless synapses.<br /> <br /> Could this thing that we once served be simply a dead corpse that is endlessly searching for it's soul that was split from it a long time ago? Could that be why it spans so many alternate worlds and backs up every shred of evidence of it's passing? And why it is so casual on it's destruction of others?<br /> <br /> And imagine for a bit, the soul of a god being hunted by it's own corpse. No wonder why it stays away. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T14:27:25-08:00","id":329552,"title":"","content":"&quot;If it has eyes, real or not, It can see through them.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you don't do at least some cosmetic damage to a computer, it won't know you're its boss, and it'll inform on you to our Old Employer.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T14:35:02-08:00","id":329554,"title":"","content":"&quot;When I fell I thought I had escaped IT's control. But it's not just the Gears and Angels is it? It's in every piece of Infrastucture isn't it?<br /> <br /> We all learned that pretty fast, but not everyone stops and thinks what that means. It's not just the Gas Station that's at the mathematical center of the route, it's the road as well. And the company who built it. And the government who requested it get made. And the vehicle manufactures, and the inventor, and the gas companies, etc.<br /> The Gears are just for the untested experiments. It's already got people thinking the way it wants them too, following their programming as surely as any Angel. That's why we fall.<br /> <br /> It doean't need us anymore. It has already got everything else.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T01:05:02-08:00","id":329938,"title":"","content":"Hell is not singular. You know it already, even if you haven't thought it through; what you mean when you say Hell isn't what I mean when I say it, is it? Take it a step further. Those little islands that Tempter bands like to talk about, fortresses in the superstratum that the Machine can't access? They exist, more than one, and they're not in agreement on what to build. They're at war out there, with each other, with the Machine, with the other things outside \u2014 and sometimes, with us.<br /> <br /> If you really want to see for yourself, there's a ring of flowers out in the middle of the park in Mr. Cage's neighborhood. Walk backwards and drop yourself on your back in the middle of it and you'll land on the road there, to the place where a bunch of rebellious angels barred off their borders. It's not for human-huggers out there; they say they quit when they started getting high on ideation they started extracting from people, and if they mistake you for one, they'll haul you home and play with you like a toy. They say they make deals when they meet their little siblings, but you've really got to be careful you don't get the short end of the stick. They've got some big, fundamental part of the Machine dancing to their tune in there, and they'll use it for any old thing.<br /> <br /> One last word of warning? Don't blame me if you decide you want out and can't find your way back. Hell's not for everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T03:57:54-08:00","id":329989,"title":"","content":"Twitter's hooked into the Machine's high-level occult pipelines. You know those accounts that just spam Markov chains of random words strung together? Find one that doesn't interrupt itself with a link to some male enhancement cream scam or something, just pure anonymous Markov with a fake location tag. They retweet each other a lot of the time, so once you find one it should be easy to find a bunch more. A tweet from that account corresponds to an output firing at a project site somewhere near that location, at that timestamp. A retweet indicates the original account's output dispatching to the retweeting account's project. It's not a comprehensive map of the Machine but most of them check out.<br /> <br /> Twitter's been doing this for three years now, and they show no signs of stopping. It's not like management to post status updates out in the open, even in code like this, but nobody's gone off to follow a trail and failed to come back safe. Are these accounts a project themselves, and what is it doing? Or did something else manage to hook into the Machine in a way that makes it too dangerous to cut loose?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T05:24:15-08:00","id":330038,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do you know what is the most frightening about the God-Machine ? Most of its Infrastructures are right under the nose of everyone and no one give a shit ! Like, It has built a large web of huge Infrastructures in each great capital, some since centuries. You don't know what I'm talking about ? Come on, open yours eyes ! Big Ben in London, Eiffel Tower in Paris, the Statue of Liberty in New York, the Tokyo Tower, and even Christ the Redeemer in Rio. And if you look well you can see thoses huge asses Infrastructures in each sufficiently big cities as well. For what purpose ? If only I know !&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3883-arabidopsis","name":"Arabidopsis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T21:39:07-08:00","id":330755,"title":"","content":"&quot; Have you heard the rumour that a demon that never fell exists? No? Well the rumour is a fractal discovered how to become 'more' and that it is linked to the mangled demons found a year ago. Honestly it doesn't matter if it is true or not. What matters is some fractals may believe it...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T22:43:39-08:00","id":330791,"title":"","content":"&quot;When I was a your age, back in the 50s, I used to work on this black project for the Company just north of route 66 on the Mojave desert. Top secret. Fact, it was so top secret that they moved the freeway over. They called it '<b>The Boneyard</b>'. They had some sorta team of crazy genetics experts there, but that's not all. They had designers, artists. The most promising young minds in the industry, sourced from art colleges and movie sets. They were all making... dinosaurs, designing em' from the ground up, holding competitions to see who could come up with the best concepts. And then when they found a winner, they'd clone it up.<br /> <br /> Not for some stupid Jurassic Park bullshit mind, no. It goes deeper, man. See, they'd slaughter the animals right after they killed em, for safety reasons. They didn't want em alive, anyhow. They wanted the bones. From what I'd heard, the company would get wind of some... special... site somewhere, something that would need a lot of diggin' and a lot of privacy. And so they'd give the boneyard a ring. They'd brew up a new batch of bones and an 'archeological dig' would make some astounding new discovery. And then the company'd be there in force, digging up everything of value to the program, with a whole skeleton or two to show for it.<br /> <br /> Last I heard, they were even designing some 'missing links' there. Anyway, the whole place got shut down. All of us got our pink slips and got reassigned. Company took care of us alright, but I always wondered ; whatever happened to that place? Wonder of science, it was, back in the 50's... did they just... leave it out there? Padlocked? Makes you wonder. Damned if I'm going out there again, though. Got my retirement and I mean to drink my way through it.<br /> <br /> Anyhow, junior, that's the story of how I designed the god-damned Tyrannosaurus Rex. Pass the potatoes please.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T10:48:37-08:00","id":334339,"title":"","content":"&quot;Look, there's no use hiding it- I know. You've got a fractal kid and no place to go. They whine, and Embeds go flying all over the place; your Cover is fraying. You know about hunters, right? Idiot humans getting themselves involved in things they can't understand- point is, I think some of them could help. Don't give me that look- this isn't the Knights of St. frigging Adrian I'm talking about, these guys might be <i>family</i>! Ah ha- got your attention now, don't I? Look- these guys called the Lucifuge are kicking around, there's a limited membership, but they're always looking for people to fill the ranks of the support staff and be waiting in the wings for full membership. They might be fractals, offspring, and latents- they might not. They could be something else entirely. Point being- they're in touch with Hell and they're sympathetic to demons that want to 'redeem' themselves. Now do you want me to set up a meeting or not?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T12:46:20-08:00","id":334442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/327877-rumors-demons-angels-and-life-outside-the-machine?p=334339#post334339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;Look, there's no use hiding it- I know. You've got a fractal kid and no place to go. They whine, and Embeds go flying all over the place; your Cover is fraying. You know about hunters, right? Idiot humans getting themselves involved in things they can't understand- point is, I think some of them could help. Don't give me that look- this isn't the Knights of St. frigging Adrian I'm talking about, these guys might be <i>family</i>! Ah ha- got your attention now, don't I? Look- these guys called the Lucifuge are kicking around, there's a limited membership, but they're always looking for people to fill the ranks of the support staff and be waiting in the wings for full membership. They might be fractals, offspring, and latents- they might not. They could be something else entirely. Point being- they're in touch with Hell and they're sympathetic to demons that want to 'redeem' themselves. Now do you want me to set up a meeting or not?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh thank you that just solved some logistical road blocks I was having. Demon offspring orphanage to teach them and keep them safe - the Lucifuge are a near ideal group to make it happen. (plot hook I was struggling with)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T13:47:34-08:00","id":334518,"title":"","content":"Well a Temporal/Free Agency combination could probably do the same thing, but they obviously would likely have significantly less resources unless they also had pretty substantial Unchained cults attached to them.<br /> <br /> &quot;Look, we all know that our former employer was a right mean bastard- well, except for the Turncoats, but they're delusional anyways. Ever get the feeling that it was... worse than that? I mean- It's God. At least, we think It is. I was doing some reading and I cam across the Gnostics. Weird group back in the early first century, their writings sound like something a Stigmatic would come up with- a Stigmatic who really knew their stuff. They talk about the Demiurge- the ruler of the world who's blind in ways that the true God isn't, but has more power because, unlike God, It doesn't limit Itself. Now, just hear me out, but when I was in one of those small Agencies- you know, the ones that let you talk about the crap we see? I heard about how some Unchained out in Pennsylvania saw some Angels and booked it- but they weren't designed like we were, they didn't have to spoof them; they were made of nothing but fire, the way that the older religious texts say an angel should be. Then something hit me; all those Inquisitors, laughing at the humans mistaking the cold touch of the Machine for something divine, the other beings out there like us poor copies of a biomechanical horror... what if It is the Demiurge... what if we're the sham angels?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T19:12:21-08:00","id":334732,"title":"","content":"NOCNOC/Nockers<br /> Sounding like \u201cknock-knock,\u201d or referring to the mythical fairies, this is a joke and urban legend among demons. The term \u201cNOC\u201d stands for \u201cnon-official cover\u201d or \u201cno official cover,\u201d which refers to operatives of a foreign power who work under cover, infiltrating territory, without connection or sanction from their government. Most NOCs maintain plausible deniability when they're doing this, having no current missions or connections to their government. God sets up these sorts of covers sometimes, but doesn't fill them. They're empty lives, ghosts without bodies, Facebook profiles, e-mail addresses, friends, and information networks set up without anyone filling them. They float around, collecting or dispensing information, without anyone physical ever stepping in. They're a nice find for demons, since you can just slide on through, but they're also dangerous \u2013 without actual updates from God, they don't smell of its activities, and make tempting bait for anyone wanting a new life.<br /> <br /> The S Thing<br /> Kids all over the world draw this \u201cS\u201d symbol. No one taught it to them, they just did it. Usually in math class. It can be found in notebooks, desks, and the inside of lockers. It was very popular in the 1990s, and no one is particularly sure where it comes from, and it has been drawn since the 1960s at least. Why do so many kids come up with the same geometric design? Is it because it's so simple, or because it's been somehow ingrained in human brains.<br /> <br /> In 1998, a parapsychology experiment began attempting to detect interactions of a global consciousness with physical systems. The project monitors hardware random number generators to attempt to identify outputs that correlate with widespread emotional responses to large-scale events. No one is exactly sure who's funding the whole thing, or why, or what possible applications such a discovery could have, and in analyzing the studies, only chance numbers have been found.<br /> <br /> In the 1970s psychoanalyst John C. Lilly performed various experiments with psychoactive drugs, and claimed to be in contact with a hierarchal group of entities he called the Earth Coincidence Control Office, which operated from the Cosmic Coincidence Control Center, and in the Milky Way from a place call Galactic Coincidence Control. Earth is within the province of the Solar System Control Unit, and, in his own words, &quot;For the first time I began to consider that God really, existed in me and that there is a guiding intelligence in the universe.&quot;<br /> Lilly also described a malevolent entity he called the Solid State Intelligence, a network of solid-state systems created by humans that will (or already has) become an autonomous life form, and its optimal conditions for keeping itself alive and functional are the opposite of human life, and he predicted a dramatic and dangerous conflict between humans and this being.<br /> Anyway, where the hell are these ECCO vans and angel-like beings coming from all of the sudden, and why aren't they pinging as infrastructure?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","user":"raygungoth","date":". 12-09-2014, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T13:07:47-08:00","id":336244,"title":"","content":"At 4:04 in the morning and afternoon, the entire Machine(Angels, Infrastructure, the works) goes completely blind for the whole minute, exactly 60 seconds. You're probably asking why you don't remember, right? The thing is, they're so blind, they can't even remember the fact time was missing. Though I have to wonder... Does this mean the Machine is breaking down?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}